1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:03,478
Your brain can't stop reading. Let me prove it.

2
00:00:03,498 --> 00:00:07,063
Don't read the word. Say the color of the letters.

3
00:00:07,363 --> 00:00:09,809
Level one. Go!

4
00:00:19,359 --> 00:00:22,189
Easy, right? That's because two of them matched.

5
00:00:22,209 --> 00:00:24,324
Level two. Faster.

6
00:00:24,344 --> 00:00:26,716
None of them match. Go!

7
00:00:34,766 --> 00:00:37,772
Did you feel that tiny pause before every color?

8
00:00:37,792 --> 00:00:41,760
Reading is so automatic that it can interfere with naming colors.

9
00:00:41,780 --> 00:00:44,574
Final round. Ignore my voice. Only trust the color you see.

10
00:00:44,594 --> 00:00:45,588
Go!

11
00:00:54,138 --> 00:00:54,783
Stop!

12
00:00:54,803 --> 00:00:57,061
How many did you get right? Be honest.

13
00:00:57,081 --> 00:00:58,577
Drop your score in the comments!

14
00:00:58,597 --> 00:01:02,343
Nineteen out of nineteen? I don't believe you.

